<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Inter', Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f7f6; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 20px; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .header { text-align: center; border-bottom: 2px solid #f0f0f0; padding-bottom: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .logo { max-width: 150px; }
        .content { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .highlight { font-weight: bold; color: #0284c7; }
        .credentials { background-color: #f8fafc; padding: 15px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin: 20px 0; font-family: monospace; font-size: 15px; }
        .footer { text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #888; margin-top: 30px; border-top: 1px solid #f0f0f0; padding-top: 20px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <img class="logo" src="{{#if schoolLogo}}{{schoolLogo}}{{else}}https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Nuvana+School&background=0284c7&color=fff&size=150{{/if}}" alt="School Logo" />
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello <span class="highlight">{{name}}</span>,</p>
            <p>Welcome to Nuvana! Your account has been officially created. You can now log into the portal to access your dashboard, classes, and materials.</p>

            <p>Here are your initial login credentials. We strongly recommend changing your password after your first login.</p>

            <div class="credentials">
                <strong>Email:</strong> {{email}}<br>
                <strong>Password:</strong> {{password}}
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, please reply to this email.</p>
            <p>&copy; 2025 Nuvana Education Platform. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
